"Your account remains linked to its assigned institution. Dashboards, tables,"
" searches, and exports use that same institutional scope."
msgstr ""
"Ihr Konto bleibt mit der ihm zugewiesenen Institution verknüpft. Dashboards,"
" Tabellen, Suchen und Exporte verwenden denselben institutionellen Rahmen."

