#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid "Harvesting access"
msgstr "Zugriff für die Metadatenernte"

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid "5 sections"
msgstr "5 Bereiche"

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid "Register repositories and manage their private URLs."
msgstr "Registrieren Sie Repositorien und verwalten Sie deren private URLs."

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid "Register repositories and manage a private harvesting URL for each one."
msgstr ""
"Registrieren Sie Repositorien und verwalten Sie für jedes eine private URL "
"zur Metadatenernte."

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid "Access mode"
msgstr "Zugriffsmodus"

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid "Private URLs only"
msgstr "Nur private URLs"

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid "General URL allowed"
msgstr "Allgemeine URL zugelassen"

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid ""
"The repository URI identifies the recipient. The generated private URL "
"grants access, including from a browser. Keep it confidential; it works "
"independently of Cloudflare or the repository IP address."
msgstr ""
"Die URI des Repositoriums bezeichnet den Empfänger. Die erzeugte private URL"
" gewährt Zugriff, auch über einen Browser. Behandeln Sie sie vertraulich; "
"sie funktioniert unabhängig von Cloudflare oder der IP-Adresse des "
"Repositoriums."

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid "Allow harvesting only through registered private URLs"
msgstr "Metadatenernte nur über registrierte private URLs zulassen"

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid ""
"Register a repository and configure its private URL in the harvester before "
"enabling this option. The general institutional URL will stop working."
msgstr ""
"Registrieren Sie ein Repositorium und konfigurieren Sie dessen private URL "
"im Harvester, bevor Sie diese Option aktivieren. Die allgemeine "
"institutionelle URL funktioniert dann nicht mehr."

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid "Save access mode"
msgstr "Zugriffsmodus speichern"

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid ""
"An OAI User assigned to this institution can register repositories and "
"manage their private URLs."
msgstr ""
"Ein dieser Einrichtung zugeordneter OAI-Nutzer kann Repositorien "
"registrieren und deren private URLs verwalten."

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid "Register repository"
msgstr "Repositorium registrieren"

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid "Repository URI"
msgstr "URI des Repositoriums"

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid ""
"Use the repository HTTP or HTTPS address without credentials, query "
"parameters, or a fragment. Up to 20 repositories per institution."
msgstr ""
"Verwenden Sie die HTTP- oder HTTPS-Adresse ohne Zugangsdaten, "
"Abfrageparameter oder Fragment. Bis zu 20 Repositorien pro Institution."

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid "Generate private URL"
msgstr "Private URL erzeugen"

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid "Registered repositories"
msgstr "Registrierte Repositorien"

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid "Revoked"
msgstr "Widerrufen"

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid "Private harvesting URL"
msgstr "Private URL zur Metadatenernte"

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid "Generate new URL"
msgstr "Neue URL erzeugen"

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid "Revoke access"
msgstr "Zugriff widerrufen"

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid "Remove repository"
msgstr "Repositorium entfernen"

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid "The previous private URL will stop working. Continue?"
msgstr "Die bisherige private URL funktioniert dann nicht mehr. Fortfahren?"

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid "No repositories registered yet."
msgstr "Noch keine Repositorien registriert."

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid "The general URL is blocked. Use a registered private harvesting URL."
msgstr ""
"Die allgemeine URL ist gesperrt. Verwenden Sie eine registrierte private URL"
" zur Metadatenernte."

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid ""
"Ask the responsible team to configure this OAI-PMH provider before managing "
"harvesting access."
msgstr ""
"Bitten Sie das zuständige Team, diesen OAI-PMH-Anbieter zu konfigurieren, "
"bevor Sie den Zugriff für die Metadatenernte verwalten."

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid ""
"Enter an HTTP or HTTPS repository URI without credentials, query parameters,"
" or a fragment."
msgstr ""
"Geben Sie eine HTTP- oder HTTPS-URI des Repositoriums ohne Zugangsdaten, "
"Abfrageparameter oder Fragment ein."

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid "Each repository URI must appear only once."
msgstr "Jede Repositoriums-URI darf nur einmal vorkommen."

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid "You can register up to 20 repositories per institution."
msgstr "Sie können bis zu 20 Repositorien pro Institution registrieren."

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid "Add at least one active repository before restricting harvesting access."
msgstr ""
"Fügen Sie mindestens ein aktives Repository hinzu, bevor Sie den Zugriff für"
" die Metadatenernte beschränken."

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid "Harvesting access updated for this institution."
msgstr "Zugriff für die Metadatenernte für diese Einrichtung aktualisiert."

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid ""
"An OAI User can register repository URIs, copy a private URL for each "
"harvester, revoke or replace it, and block the general URL. Anyone with a "
"private URL can read the OAI metadata, including in a browser; keep it "
"confidential."
msgstr ""
"Ein OAI-Benutzer kann Repositoriums-URIs registrieren, für jeden Harvester "
"eine private URL kopieren, sie widerrufen oder ersetzen und die allgemeine "
"URL sperren. Jeder mit einer privaten URL kann OAI-Metadaten lesen, auch im "
"Browser; behandeln Sie sie vertraulich."

#: app/blueprints/oai_pmh.py app/templates/oai_pmh/harvesting_access.html
msgid ""
"In DSpace-CRIS, use this private base URL as the OAI Provider, choose Simple"
" Dublin Core (oai_dc), and harvest metadata only. Start or schedule "
"harvesting in DSpace; no DataORCID sign-in is needed."
msgstr ""
"Verwenden Sie in DSpace-CRIS diese private Basis-URL als OAI Provider, "
"wählen Sie Simple Dublin Core (oai_dc) und ernten Sie nur Metadaten. Starten"
" oder planen Sie die Metadatenernte in DSpace; eine Anmeldung bei DataORCID "
"ist nicht erforderlich."

